*To: Hiring Team*

Dear Hiring Manager, I am a Computer Science, Finance, and Statistics student at the University of Waterloo excited to apply for the Full Stack Engineer position at Katalyze AI. Through internships spanning software engineering, AI research, and data-intensive applications, I have developed strong experience building end-to-end solutions using React, TypeScript, Python, Java, REST APIs, SQL databases, and cloud technologies. At Waterloo Aerial Robotics Group, I rebuilt telemetry and dashboard systems using React/TypeScript and Python-based services, while at Manulife I automated cloud-native developer workflows supporting thousands of engineers. As a University of Waterloo research assistant, I trained and evaluated machine learning models on large-scale datasets, collaborating closely with researchers to integrate AI-driven capabilities and deliver high-performance solutions. My experience with Azure, AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, database optimization, and full software development lifecycles, combined with a strong interest in applying technology to healthcare and biopharmaceutical innovation, would allow me to contribute effectively to Katalyze AI's mission of building intelligent software that improves manufacturing efficiency and reliability. Thank you for your time and consideration, and I look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your team.
\ Sincerely, \
Jian Feng

